      "message": "We can\u0027t do that because pulse_led_deferred() is using pulse_led_deferred_data which is being supplied from DECLARE_DEFERRED.\nso, we can\u0027t move DECLARE_DEFERRED(pulse_led_deferred);  after pulse_led_deferred() function definition.\n\n#define DECLARE_DEFERRED(routine)                                    \\\n        K_WORK_DELAYABLE_DEFINE(routine##_work_data,                 \\\n                                (void (*)(struct k_work *))routine); \\\n        __maybe_unused const struct deferred_data routine##_data \u003d { \\\n                .work \u003d \u0026routine##_work_data,                \\\n        }\n        \n\nDECLARE_DEFERRED also requires pulse_led_deferred() as routine name so we can\u0027t remove static void pulse_led_deferred(void); declaration before DECLARE_DEFERRED.",
